      "id": "1",
      "title": "Situation overview",
      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "1a",
          "title": "Overview",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "text": "A severe tornado impacted Ostley County, including Estenwick, Dray Corners, and the Millrow district, resulting in significant casualties, destruction of critical infrastructure, and mass displacement.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [],
              "id": "1a.1"
            },
            {
              "text": "Authorities confirmed multiple deaths and dozens of injuries across the area, alongside severe damage to roadways and educational facilities.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [],
              "id": "1a.2"
            },
            {
              "text": "Emergency services and local police have deployed to affected sectors, while road closures and facility restorations are underway.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [],
              "id": "1a.3"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "title": "Timeline",
      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "2a",
          "title": "Chronological timeline",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "text": "On May 19 at 15:38 UTC, a tornado warning was issued for Estenwick and Ostley County.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                3,
                4
              ],
              "id": "2a.1"
            },
            {
              "text": "By 19:00 UTC on May 19, evacuations commenced from Estenwick and Dray Corners.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                14,
                17
              ],
              "id": "2a.2"
            },
            {
              "text": "Damage in the Millrow district and the destruction of Route 12 and the grain elevator were reported between 19:16 and 19:47 UTC on May 19.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                16,
                18,
                20
              ],
              "id": "2a.3"
            },
            {
              "text": "Between 21:50 and 22:15 UTC on May 19, fatalities and police deployments were reported in the Millrow district.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                41,
                44,
                48,
                49
              ],
              "id": "2a.4"
            },
            {
              "text": "On May 20, official reports confirmed 38 injuries in Estenwick and a cumulative total of 9 deaths across Ostley County.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                59,
                80,
                82,
                89
              ],
              "id": "2a.5"
            },
            {
              "text": "Between May 21 and May 23, assessments revealed the destruction of Estenwick Consolidated School and the gymnasium, displacement of 240 individuals, road closures, and subsequent restoration efforts.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                118,
                140,
                143,
                169,
